 'type': 'v', 'title': 'Marian Apparitions of the 20th Century', 'poster': 'https://canvas-bridge.tubitv.com/sgKVqhIDEEVx4CoPiOoc9u6RExk=/400x574/smart/img.adrise.tv/8c76bc35-1317-4af3-8b60-927d091c999a.png', 'year': '1992', 'genre': ['Documentary'], 'plot': 'Year: 1992\nDuration: 58 mins\nPlot: Narrated by Ricardo Montalban Marian Apparitions of the 20th Century is a documentary about real apparitions that have been filmed and documented In May 2017 the Catholic Church celebrated the 100 year anniversary of the Blessed Virgin Marys appearances to 3 small children that first occurred in 1917 She gave them an important message for the world The first 7 apparitions in Fatima were approved by the Catholic Church and throughout the 20th century the Blessed Mother of God has continued to appear to children all over the world In this film you will also see actual footage of the visionary seeing the Blessed Mother with close up views of their reactions and emotions Most of these apparitions you will view have been approved by the Catholic church The amazing photos taken of The Blessed Virgin Mary in Egypt have been authenticated by scientists One apparition which is documented in this film occurred in a small village called Medjugorje (located in Bosnia and Herzegovina) and is still occurring to this very day The Catholic Church in May of 2017 and a committee of 14 Cardinals and theologians study the children for over 4 years and voted 131 that the first 7 apparitions (similar to Fatima) were of supernatural origin Over 40 million people have already traveled to this tiny village and millions of lives have changed forever after experiencing what is happening in this gracefilled place where the Blessed Mother still appears The message is urgent and the apparitions are real', 'duration': 3508, 'media_type': 'episode', 'tmdb_id': 'marian apparitions of the 20th century|1992', 'tvshowtitle': ''}, {'id': '605781', 'type': 'v', 'title': 'Found', 'poster': 'https://canvas-bridge0